= List of Abbreviations

/ API: Application Programming Interface
/ BM25: Best Matching 25 (keyword ranking function)
/ CI: Confidence Interval
/ CLAP: Crowd Listener for releAse Planning
/ CPU: Central Processing Unit
/ CUSUM: Cumulative Sum (control chart)
/ c-TF-IDF: Class-based Term Frequency–Inverse Document Frequency
/ EWMA: Exponentially Weighted Moving Average
/ HDBSCAN: Hierarchical Density-Based Spatial Clustering of Applications with Noise
/ HOD: Head of Department
/ JSON: JavaScript Object Notation
/ JWT: JSON Web Token
/ LLM: Large Language Model
/ LOPO: Leave One Product Out
/ LSH: Locality-Sensitive Hashing
/ MiniLM: Mini Language Model (distilled transformer)
/ RCA: Root-Cause Analysis
/ REP: Retrieval function for duplicate bug reports (Sun et al.)
/ REST: Representational State Transfer
/ RoBERTa: Robustly Optimised BERT Pre-training Approach
/ RR\@5: Recall Rate at 5
/ SaaS: Software as a Service
/ SMTP: Simple Mail Transfer Protocol
/ SQL: Structured Query Language
/ UMAP: Uniform Manifold Approximation and Projection
/ VoC: Voice of the Customer
